{"type":"message","id":"19130385","parentId":"3995cdf8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T00:00:39.384Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"`gh api --search`는 존재하지 않는 플래그입니다. GitHub Search API를 직접 호출해야 합니다. REST API 엔드포인트를 사용하겠습니다:\n\n- Search repositories: `/search/repositories?q=...`\n\n정확한 엔드포인트로 다시 시도합니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_41a48bea526d4decbcb2ff30","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh api \"search/repositories?q=created:>2026-03-26&sort=stars&order=desc&per_page=10\" --jq '.items[] | {name: .full_name, stars: .stargazers_count, desc: .description, url: .html_url}'","timeout":30}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b01b19a54f964a19906b61ca","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh api \"search/repositories?q=archived:false&sort=stars&order=desc&per_page=10\" --jq '.items[] | {name: .full_name, stars: .stargazers_count, desc: .description, url: .html_url, updated: .updated_at}'","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":662,"output":303,"cacheRead":21169,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22134,"cost":{"input":0.0003972,"output":0.0006666,"cacheRead":0.00232859,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0033923900000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775088029939,"responseId":"20260402080033d4e8018ca1c74d43"}}
{"type":"message","id":"db23654a","parentId":"19130385","timestamp":"2026-04-02T00:00:39.989Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_41a48bea526d4decbcb2ff30","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"desc\":\"The fastest repo in history to surpass 100K stars ⭐. Better Harness Tools that make real things done. Built in Rust using oh-my-codex.\",\"name\":\"instructkr/claw-code\",\"stars\":119264,\"url\":\"https://github.com/instructkr/claw-code\"}\n{\"desc\":\"Research on Coding Agents\",\"name\":\"sanbuphy/learn-coding-agent\",\"stars\":10502,\"url\":\"https://github.com/sanbuphy/learn-coding-agent\"}\n{\"desc\":\"Use Codex from Claude Code to review code or delegate tasks.\",\"name\":\"openai/codex-plugin-cc\",\"stars\":8400,\"url\":\"https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc\"}\n{\"desc\":\"原汁原昧 Claude Code 可运行版; Bun 可编译执行版; Typescript 类型全修复; 企业级可靠性; 安全无毒, lock 文件保真, 可直接 bun i; bun run dev 启动\",\"name\":\"claude-code-best/claude-code\",\"stars\":7484,\"url\":\"https://github.com/claude-code-best/claude-code\"}\n{\"desc\":null,\"name\":\"ChinaSiro/claude-code-sourcemap\",\"stars\":7301,\"url\":\"https://github.com/ChinaSiro/claude-code-sourcemap\"}\n{\"desc\":\"Your favorite Terminal Coding Agent, now in Rust \\u0026 a Breakdown of the Claude Code leak \\u0026 discoveries\",\"name\":\"Kuberwastaken/claurst\",\"stars\":6513,\"url\":\"https://github.com/Kuberwastaken/claurst\"}\n{\"desc\":\"将冰冷的离别化为温暖的 Skill，欢迎加入数字生命1.0！Transforming cold farewells into warm skills? It's giving rebirth era. Welcome to Digital Life 1.0. 🫶\",\"name\":\"titanwings/colleague-skill\",\"stars\":4610,\"url\":\"https://github.com/titanwings/colleague-skill\"}\n{\"desc\":\"Claude Code opened to any LLM — OpenAI, Gemini, DeepSeek, Ollama, and 200+ models via OpenAI-compatible API shim\",\"name\":\"Gitlawb/openclaude\",\"stars\":3307,\"url\":\"https://github.com/Gitlawb/openclaude\"}\n{\"desc\":\"AI Agent 源码深度研究报告\",\"name\":\"tvytlx/ai-agent-deep-dive\",\"stars\":3000,\